  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICF Optimum Tef - Crop Genetic Innovation Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Optimum Tef project is a collaboration between the FCDO and the Gates Foundation to enhance the productivity of tef, a staple crop in Ethiopia. Using cutting-edge technology, the project will focus on improving grain yield and various other characteristics of tef which currently undermine its productivity and contribution to smallholder livelihoods and food security. Led by the Ethiopian Institute of Agricultural Research (EIAR), the project will deliver improved varieties of tef, assess the socio-economic impacts of tef improvements, and build crop genetic innovation capacity at EIAR.</narrative>
  </description>
